# The processing pipeline writes the committed embeddings index to data/index/:
#   chunks.jsonl     one line per chunk: {id, doc, page, text}
#   embeddings.npy   float32 matrix, row-aligned with chunks.jsonl
#   meta.json        model name, dimension, count, normalization flag
#
# These ARE committed (corpus PDFs are not). That is how a teammate can run the
# app without ever receiving the source documents.
